WEBVTT

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.800
Fire! Put out the fire!

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:29.333
Rebels! Rebels have entered the grounds!

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:32.500
They're heading to His Majesty's
sleeping quarters! Somebody!

00:00:40.433 --> 00:00:43.867
It's a Slave! A Slave! Fight back!

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:51.967
The princess isn't here! Find her! Find her!

00:01:11.633 --> 00:01:13.033
You must live...

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:28.633
The highly regarded Blue Sky Sapphire is
nothing without the power of the Otome.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:05.600
Another failed lead. Well, I didn't
expect the search to be easy.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.600
--Hey! Kurochs!
--Kurochs!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.900
Kurochs?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.533
Mister, there's something over there.

00:02:12.533 --> 00:02:15.067
Oh? Young boy, that's garbage.

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.500
It's not! It's really big garbage!

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.967
--Those are Kurochs, all right.
--They really are Kurochs.

00:02:22.867 --> 00:02:25.967
I'm told Kurochs bring good luck.

00:02:25.967 --> 00:02:27.867
In what way?

00:02:27.867 --> 00:02:30.533
They bring couples together, like right now.

00:02:30.533 --> 00:02:32.367
What are you getting at?

00:02:42.967 --> 00:02:44.567
Huh?

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.667
I was hoping they would
come over and help me.

00:02:52.467 --> 00:02:57.433
Huh? Hey! Wait up! Come on, help me!

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:11.000
"My-Otome"

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.733
<i>I found a dream</i>

00:03:14.733 --> 00:03:19.333
<i>I can't stop this thrilling feeling</i>

00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:24.767
<i>My star dream</i>

00:03:24.767 --> 00:03:30.367
<i>A new treasure is born</i>

00:03:30.367 --> 00:03:33.633
<i>It's filling my heart</i>

00:03:33.633 --> 00:03:37.500
<i>And it's beginning to shine brightly</i>

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:44.033
<i>What is it that's making me so anxious?</i>

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:47.667
<i>Unable to control these feelings</i>

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:53.333
<i>My tears flow out</i>

00:03:53.333 --> 00:04:00.100
<i>I'm sure that I'll get there one day</i>

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:06.533
<i>Even if I stumble I won't give up</i>

00:04:06.533 --> 00:04:13.500
<i>With courage, let's keep moving forward</i>

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:18.967
<i>Take one small step and you will see</i>

00:04:18.967 --> 00:04:24.567
<i>A brand new me</i>

00:04:31.467 --> 00:04:36.033
"Dreamy ☆ Arika"

00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:45.733
Excuse me.

00:04:45.733 --> 00:04:48.900
You're the number-one-ranked Coral,
Miss Nina Wang, right?

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.467
Ah, I didn't order this.

00:04:51.467 --> 00:04:53.433
It's from the customer over there.

00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:56.833
To the future Otome.

00:04:56.833 --> 00:04:58.000
To the beautiful Otome.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.700
To the Otome!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.967
W-Water...

00:05:04.967 --> 00:05:07.400
W...

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:11.433
Th-Thank you very much. I appreciate this.

00:05:28.967 --> 00:05:30.733
What happened, Nina?

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:36.667
Father?

00:05:36.667 --> 00:05:39.467
Nina. Ah, your legs...

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:47.733
I have an uneasy feeling.

00:05:47.733 --> 00:05:50.900
You may be onto something.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:55.367
The coronation ceremony for the princess
is being held next week, right?

00:05:55.367 --> 00:05:59.633
It seems a number of people
have snuck into Wind City.

00:05:59.633 --> 00:06:00.900
Damn Schwarz.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.733
They're aware that even
though we're right here,

00:06:02.733 --> 00:06:06.433
our pact with Wind Castle
prohibits us from taking any action.

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.767
They're bound to try something this year.

00:06:09.767 --> 00:06:13.900
After all, it's been fourteen years
since that incident.

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:17.767
But, we still haven't found "the girl."

00:06:17.767 --> 00:06:20.667
That's precisely why
I had you return, Shizuru.

00:06:20.667 --> 00:06:26.033
Part of the job for us "Five Pillars"
is to help the academy.

00:06:26.033 --> 00:06:29.700
And Garderobe continues
to be in an awkward position.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:33.867
Well, in any case, we can do nothing
but wait for something to happen

00:06:33.867 --> 00:06:35.433
and then deal with it.

00:06:35.433 --> 00:06:36.967
I'm counting on you.

00:06:36.967 --> 00:06:42.867
It's also my job to listen to
your problems, Headmistress.

00:06:51.567 --> 00:06:54.067
I'm very sorry, Father.

00:06:54.067 --> 00:06:56.400
To have done something so embarrassing...

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.400
Don't worry about it.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:02.067
It was an accident.
An unfortunate accident, Neena.

00:07:02.067 --> 00:07:04.600
A really unfortunate accident, Father!

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.900
Um...

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.367
Uh... Well...

00:07:11.667 --> 00:07:17.067
Oh, right! Here! And thank you
for the juice, Neena!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.933
Nina.

00:07:19.933 --> 00:07:24.633
It's Nina! Only my father can call me Neena!

00:07:24.633 --> 00:07:26.933
Father?

00:07:26.933 --> 00:07:28.333
Why is that?

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:30.667
--I dunno.
--Major!

00:07:32.067 --> 00:07:35.333
I take it your trip to your
home country went well.

00:07:36.333 --> 00:07:38.933
Nina. Thanks for coming to see me.

00:07:38.933 --> 00:07:40.500
Sure.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.100
And you...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.733
Now I know what you remind me of!

00:07:45.733 --> 00:07:47.333
An ant!

00:07:48.567 --> 00:07:50.033
An ant?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:56.467
Don't call me an ant!
My name is Arika! Arika Yumemiya!

00:07:56.467 --> 00:07:58.000
Well, excuse me.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:02.833
I'm Sergey Wang, an officer at
the Embassy of the Duchy of Artai.

00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:06.833
I don't like ants! And I don't
like anyone calling me an ant!

00:08:08.733 --> 00:08:11.367
I sort of like it. Arika the ant.

00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:13.100
Wait! I wanna thank you for the juice!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.433
--Never mind.
--But...

00:08:15.433 --> 00:08:17.600
It wouldn't be right not to!

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.367
My grandma told me I should
always return a favor.

00:08:20.367 --> 00:08:21.833
Then you can stop following me.

00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:25.000
You're a pest, you're an eyesore,
and you irritate me.

00:08:26.467 --> 00:08:28.000
Hey, Nina.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.467
Just shut up. Stop calling me
with that loud voice!

00:08:40.467 --> 00:08:42.333
Awesome!

00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:47.733
Wow... Hey, is this...

00:08:54.733 --> 00:08:57.367
Wow. A ticket.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.567
Better not lose it.

00:09:06.933 --> 00:09:10.100
Hey, I just filled this with water. Want some?

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:13.067
Stop it, you're embarrassing me.

00:09:13.067 --> 00:09:16.333
Are you mad about something, Nina?

00:09:16.333 --> 00:09:18.433
I beg you, stop talking to me.

00:09:33.567 --> 00:09:34.967
A castle!

00:09:36.733 --> 00:09:40.033
A princess lives there, right?
What kinda person is she?

00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:43.667
Nobody knows yet. The coronation
ceremony isn't for a few more days.

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:49.600
--Princess!
--Princess! Princess!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.700
Princess! Princess!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.067
She's missing again.

00:09:56.067 --> 00:09:59.400
I've sent a search party to the city.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.400
Thanks as always for your help.

00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:24.967
Well, I have to go.

00:10:24.967 --> 00:10:28.433
Hey, wait for me, Nina!

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:31.767
Um...

00:10:31.767 --> 00:10:36.467
Sorry, but you're on your own
from here. I really need to...

00:10:36.467 --> 00:10:40.600
Um, do you know where I can find
an academy called Garderobe?

00:10:43.567 --> 00:10:45.100
Why do you want to go there?

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:47.567
I'm looking for my mother!

00:10:47.567 --> 00:10:51.600
But all I know is that she
used to serve as an Otome.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:54.433
Garderobe is a school for Otomes, right?

00:10:54.433 --> 00:10:56.667
So I was thinking, if I could
become an Otome, then...

00:10:56.667 --> 00:10:58.933
--Impossible.
--Why?

00:10:58.933 --> 00:11:02.700
You don't know anything, do you?
Where are you from?

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:04.600
Galelia.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.667
I don't know what far-off place that is,

00:11:06.667 --> 00:11:09.467
but you don't know anything about Otomes.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.400
Hey, hey! What's that?!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.500
A TV!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.833
Wow... So that's...

00:11:17.833 --> 00:11:22.667
A lot of the technology from the
Earth Era is still here in Windbloom.

00:11:22.667 --> 00:11:24.800
Is that the princess?!

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:29.433
No. She's an Otome. Meister Shizuru.

00:11:29.433 --> 00:11:34.400
She's very beautiful. M-Meister?

00:11:35.767 --> 00:11:37.433
Hey, wait up!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.633
Hey, what's this?!

00:11:43.633 --> 00:11:44.800
Hologram.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.433
Wow!

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.667
--That is too?!
--Yes.

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:52.833
That's great! It's all like magic!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.767
Then that's a hologram, too?

00:11:56.767 --> 00:11:59.600
Yeah. They're all holo...

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.067
It'll be a hundred years
before you can catch me!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.600
Move!

00:12:30.433 --> 00:12:33.500
She... passed me?!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.900
Grab it!

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:49.567
That must've taken a few years off my life.

00:12:49.567 --> 00:12:51.533
Oww...

00:12:53.933 --> 00:12:56.833
You two...

00:12:56.833 --> 00:13:01.800
You did well. I commend you.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:09.100
You girls! Return that girl to us!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:14.000
Listen, you two. You have to help me!
Those guys are evil kidnappers!

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.833
What?!

00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:20.500
Oh, no! They must be the outlaw
people Grandma told me about!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.633
Wait! We're...

00:13:30.633 --> 00:13:32.033
Stop!

00:13:40.467 --> 00:13:42.433
Wow, Nina! That was amazing!

00:13:42.433 --> 00:13:44.400
Where did she go?

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:45.800
Huh?

00:13:48.533 --> 00:13:49.967
Oh, dear...

00:14:03.667 --> 00:14:05.800
She got away?!

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:08.700
You fools! The princess'
coronation is next week!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:12.867
The princess must have done this
because it's her last chance.

00:14:12.867 --> 00:14:13.867
Right, Mikoto?

00:14:13.867 --> 00:14:15.767
Find her!

00:14:19.667 --> 00:14:21.667
I think we're safe now.

00:14:21.667 --> 00:14:23.467
I-Is that so?

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.867
What is this place?!

00:14:27.867 --> 00:14:29.333
It was the airport.

00:14:29.333 --> 00:14:32.100
--Airport?
--You really don't know anything.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.933
It's where flying machines
used to rest their wings.

00:14:34.933 --> 00:14:38.500
You're kidding. These things
used to fly? Like birds?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.367
That's amazing!

00:14:42.333 --> 00:14:45.400
This feels gross! I'm soaking wet!
Get me some dry clothes!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.833
Oh, then here!

00:14:46.833 --> 00:14:49.567
No way! That's dirty!

00:14:49.567 --> 00:14:51.967
That wasn't nice! I was only trying to help!

00:14:51.967 --> 00:14:55.500
Grandma told me if you don't
show gratitude, you'll be punished!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.467
How dare you talk to me like that!

00:14:57.467 --> 00:14:59.367
--I'm going.
--What?!

00:14:59.367 --> 00:15:01.900
I've helped you enough.
Handle the rest on your own.

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:05.833
Wait! Wait a moment!
Are you abandoning me?!

00:15:05.833 --> 00:15:07.700
I need to get back before curfew.

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:10.767
Then take a look at this!

00:15:10.767 --> 00:15:11.867
Why, you're...

00:15:11.867 --> 00:15:15.633
You people are so-called floral
ornaments who serve royalty, right?

00:15:15.633 --> 00:15:18.800
Then you better serve me! Come on!

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:21.633
Please forgive me for my rudeness!

00:15:21.633 --> 00:15:25.367
Nina! There's no reason to apologize to her!

00:15:25.367 --> 00:15:27.567
You truly don't know a thing, do you?

00:15:27.567 --> 00:15:32.867
The Otomes of Garderobe
are required to obey me.

00:15:32.867 --> 00:15:35.467
Otome?! Nina is one?!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.933
Under the contract of darkness,
I fulfill my oath.

00:15:47.933 --> 00:15:51.067
God of ancient light,
knowledge, and wisdom,

00:15:51.067 --> 00:15:54.067
grant me a loyal servant!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.100
An Otome?!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.500
Wh-What's that?

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.500
--A Slave?!
--What?

00:16:10.067 --> 00:16:11.867
Its eyes...

00:16:14.833 --> 00:16:16.433
Watch out!

00:16:28.667 --> 00:16:30.567
D-Do something about this!

00:16:30.567 --> 00:16:33.000
But you are not my Master!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:36.567
If I defeat this, Father will be...

00:16:36.567 --> 00:16:39.467
Very well. I acknowledge you
as my interim Master.

00:16:39.467 --> 00:16:41.400
Please authorize use of my Robe!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.367
Authorize? You mean...

00:16:43.367 --> 00:16:45.033
That's right! Hurry!

00:16:45.033 --> 00:16:47.700
--What is your name?
--Nina Wang.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.567
Okay, Nina Wang.

00:16:50.567 --> 00:16:55.867
My Otome, holder of the Coral stone.
In my name, I hereby free your powers!

00:16:58.367 --> 00:17:00.567
Yes, Master.

00:17:00.567 --> 00:17:02.000
Materialize!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.000
What?!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.800
That's...

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.833
A Slave? Are you certain?

00:17:31.833 --> 00:17:33.967
Yes. And at the same point,

00:17:33.967 --> 00:17:38.033
I also detect the activation of
Coral Number One Nina Wang's Robe.

00:17:38.033 --> 00:17:41.367
Thank you. Continue observing, Professor.

00:17:42.833 --> 00:17:45.500
So Schwarz has arrived.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:49.800
In Wind City. But one of our students
is battling, using her Robe.

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:52.867
--That's a breach of our agreement.
--Well, the facts suggest

00:17:52.867 --> 00:17:56.400
there is someone close by
who gave her authorization.

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.900
And the only person
from Wind who can do that...

00:17:58.900 --> 00:17:59.900
The princess?

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:05.733
If that's the case, then the breach
goes both ways, doesn't it?

00:18:05.733 --> 00:18:09.867
We now have an excuse
to intervene! Okay, let's go!

00:18:09.867 --> 00:18:11.533
We're attacking Schwarz!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.600
Mind if I borrow someone?

00:18:20.567 --> 00:18:23.667
Even if I gather my powers,
this Coral Robe isn't enough.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.067
Now I'm mad!

00:18:30.067 --> 00:18:31.967
Hey! That's...

00:18:31.967 --> 00:18:33.567
Take this!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.967
It didn't work!

00:18:38.967 --> 00:18:40.100
What were you thinking?!

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:42.633
You just made it angrier!

00:18:42.633 --> 00:18:44.033
You're right.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.100
Wait for me!

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.700
I trust you ordered the
evacuation of the palace?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.900
--Yes.
--This is the first actual battle in fifty years.

00:19:09.867 --> 00:19:12.500
Akane, focus solely on
rescuing Nina and the princess.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.567
Yes, Headmistress.

00:19:14.567 --> 00:19:16.333
Shizuru, destroy the Slave.

00:19:16.333 --> 00:19:17.967
Right.

00:19:17.967 --> 00:19:20.667
It will be fine. Just remain calm.

00:19:20.667 --> 00:19:22.700
Yes, Meister Shizuru.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.467
Okay, let them out!

00:19:36.333 --> 00:19:38.700
It's not a dream, is it?

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:41.067
Is this the power of the GEM? But...

00:19:41.067 --> 00:19:44.333
Look! The people look like little beans!

00:20:23.767 --> 00:20:25.500
Are you all right?

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.333
Akane...

00:20:28.333 --> 00:20:31.367
We were expecting to confront them
at the airport garden, but...

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:35.700
Who would've guessed
they'd appear right in the city?

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.500
Why, that's...

00:20:42.667 --> 00:20:47.900
Bewitching Smile Amethyst,
Meister Shizuru Viola.

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:49.433
An Otome is about to fight?

00:20:49.433 --> 00:20:50.833
Really?

00:20:52.333 --> 00:20:55.733
Now, it's time to clean up.

00:21:04.633 --> 00:21:07.100
There's something on your forehead.

00:21:17.567 --> 00:21:19.433
Wow! Totally wow!

00:21:19.433 --> 00:21:23.900
The appearance of a Slave...
The first Otome battle in half a century...

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:27.333
Things will get hectic around here.

00:21:27.333 --> 00:21:28.467
Nina?

00:21:28.467 --> 00:21:29.733
Did you see that?

00:21:29.733 --> 00:21:30.867
Shall we go after her?

00:21:30.867 --> 00:21:34.600
It was good that we evacuated
everyone from the palace,

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:38.033
but what will the princess say
when she sees what happened?

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:49.800
Wow! What do you call that?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.733
That's the power of the Otome.

00:21:51.733 --> 00:21:56.767
And this is Garderobe, the academy
that trains the Otomes.

00:21:56.767 --> 00:21:59.700
So this is Garderobe.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:01.100
Father!

00:22:02.433 --> 00:22:06.067
You're okay, Nina. And you. You look okay...

00:22:07.433 --> 00:22:09.433
Blue Sky Sapphire...

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:23.333
This is so cool! I'm going
to become an Otome!

00:22:23.333 --> 00:22:25.800
You can count on it!

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:29.600
<i>Courage makes your wishes come true</i>

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:31.000
<i>Do your best</i>

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:37.000
<i>Keep moving forward, so you don't lose</i>

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:49.333
<i>It has started and it's waiting right now</i>

00:22:49.333 --> 00:22:52.833
<i>A story just for me</i>

00:22:52.833 --> 00:22:56.900
<i>Instead of running from it</i>

00:22:56.900 --> 00:23:01.600
<i>I'm going to face it</i>

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.800
<i>Because that's the courage of Otome</i>

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:07.633
<i>I am doing great</i>

00:23:07.633 --> 00:23:10.467
<i>Even when I feel lonely</i>

00:23:10.467 --> 00:23:16.333
<i>I smile</i>

00:23:16.333 --> 00:23:17.600
<i>No, there is no "no"</i>

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:22.333
<i>In the world you're living in</i>

00:23:22.333 --> 00:23:26.467
<i>The future will be fun and I'll protect you</i>

00:23:26.467 --> 00:23:28.633
<i>Everything's going to be fine</i>

00:23:28.633 --> 00:23:33.967
<i>Pure thoughts are brighter than jewels</i>

00:23:33.967 --> 00:23:39.933
<i>Just keep moving forward with pride</i>

00:23:39.933 --> 00:23:46.333
<i>Just keep moving forward so you don't lose</i>

00:23:56.333 --> 00:23:59.367
"A Gust Running Through
the Garden of Otome?!"
Wow! We were hot! Sizzling hot!

00:23:59.367 --> 00:24:01.767
Yes, we were, but is this
the result you were hoping for?

00:24:01.767 --> 00:24:03.433
--Don't worry about it.
--Headmistress!

00:24:03.433 --> 00:24:06.567
This is sort of a tradition.
Well, you'll soon understand.

00:24:06.567 --> 00:24:11.456
Then we will be even hotter
during the next episode!
